     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Please take me off your mailing list.<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Apr 16, 2014 at 7:57 PM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \r\n  <a name=\"m_8068219068965956947_1456d2fe9b327693_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Today&#39;s topic summary</a></div>\r\n<p>Group: <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469045023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0katLx2o376KNQ0soCzGnx\">http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/topics</a></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8068219068965956947_1456d2fe9b327693_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Notes from vectorization in R presentation</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8068219068965956947_1456d2fe9b327693_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/t/abc3aa6e600476de\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/t/abc3aa6e600476de&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469045023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aBuHOjhwMTQPzgQaERR7c\">Notes from vectorization in R presentation</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n    <ul>\r\n      <span>Noam Ross &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">noam...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 16 11:23AM -0700\r\n       <br> <br>\r\n      Hi all,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nI&#39;ve written up notes from last week&#39;s presentation on vectorization in R.<br>\r\n You can find them at:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.noamross.net/blog/2014/4/16/vectorization-in-r--why.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.noamross.net/blog/2014/4/16/vectorization-in-r--why.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469045023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32AwJb5btlWvbOk_3jx03o\">http://www.noamross.net/blog/2014/4/16/vectorization-in-r--why.html</a>.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nFeel free to ask questions or give feedback in the comments section!<br>\r\n <br>\r\nBest,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nNoam<br>\r\n <br>\r\n--<br>\r\nNoam Ross<br>\r\nGraduate Group in Ecology<br>\r\nDepartment of Environmental Science and Policy<br>\r\nUniversity of California at Davis<br>\r\n<a href=\"tel:(646)%20244-0484\" value=\"+16462440484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+1.646.244.0484</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.noamross.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.noamross.net/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469045023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01PSCndOitpkUgH9AQP3QU\">http://www.noamross.net/</a><br>\r\ntwitter: @noamross<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n\r\n      <p> </p>\r\n    </font></span></ul><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n  \r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nCheck out our R resources at <a href=\"http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469045023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wBptOovpZOUGiDsqS7fx4\">http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed